atures.0.title" >SIMPLE TO USE</h4><p data-i18n="app.features.0.description" >Get started quickly with a clean, straightforward app across your devices.</p></article><article><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M24 44S9 28 9 18a15 15 0 1 1 30 0c0 10-15 26-15 26Z"/><circle cx="24" cy="18" r="6"/></svg><h4 data-i18n="app.features.1.title" >CHOOSE YOUR LOCATION</h4><p data-i18n="app.features.1.description" >Connect through locations across the globe to access more of the internet.</p></article><article><svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 13h22c7 0 12 22 7 25s-9-6-13-6H19c-4 0-8 9-13 6S6 13 13 13Z"/><path d="M12 19v12m-6-6h12M32 20h1m5 6h1m-7 4h1"/></svg><h4 data-i18n="app.features.2.title" >FOR EVERYDAY USE</h4><p data-i18n="app.features.2.description" >A flexible VPN for gaming, streaming, browsing and staying private online.</p></article></div></section>